            "type": "html",
            "html": "  <section class=\"bg-soft\">\n    <div class=\"container-custom\">\n      <div class=\"section-header text-center mx-auto\" data-aos=\"fade-up\">\n        <span class=\"section-eyebrow justify-content-center\">Send An Enquiry</span>\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Request A Bulk Quote</h2>\n        <p class=\"section-subtitle mx-auto\">Share your product, quantity and city — our team confirms pricing and lead time within one business day.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row g-5 align-items-stretch\">\n        <div class=\"col-lg-5\" data-aos=\"fade-right\">\n          <div class=\"map-placeholder\">\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.google.com/maps?q=8710+Roshanara+Road+Pulbangash+Delhi+110007&output=embed\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" title=\"Jaibaba Interlinings location map — Roshanara Road, Delhi\"></iframe>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"col-lg-7\" data-aos=\"fade-left\">\n          <div class=\"form-box\">\n            <form id=\"enquiryForm\" novalidate>\n              <div class=\"row g-4\">\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                  <label for=\"full_name\" class=\"form-label-custom\">Full Name <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n                  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control-custom\" id=\"full_name\" name=\"full_name\" required>\n                  <div class=\"invalid-feedback\">This field is required.</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                  <label for=\"company\" class=\"form-label-custom\">Company Name <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n                  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control-custom\" id=\"company\" name=\"company\" required>\n                  <div class=\"invalid-feedback\">This field is required.</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                  <label for=\"phone\" class=\"form-label-custom\">Phone Number <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n                  <input type=\"tel\" class=\"form-control-custom\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" pattern=\"[0-9]{10,12}\" minlength=\"10\" maxlength=\"12\" inputmode=\"numeric\" required>\n                  <div class=\"invalid-feedback\">Enter a valid phone number (10–12 digits).</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                  <label for=\"city\" class=\"form-label-custom\">City <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n                  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control-custom\" id=\"city\" name=\"city\" required>\n                  <div class=\"invalid-feedback\">This field is required.</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                  <label for=\"product\" class=\"form-label-custom\">Product Required <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n                  <select class=\"form-select-custom\" id=\"product\" name=\"product\" required>\n                    <option value=\"\" disabled selected>Select a product</option>\n                    <option value=\"Buckram Fabric\">Buckram Fabric</option>\n                    <option value=\"Fusible Interlining\">Fusible Interlining</option>\n                    <option value=\"Pocketing Cloth\">Pocketing Cloth</option>\n                    <option value=\"Readymade Collar & Cuff\">Readymade Collar &amp; Cuff</option>\n                    <option value=\"Belt Roll & Placket (Patti)\">Belt Roll &amp; Placket (Patti)</option>\n                    <option value=\"Shoulder Pads\">Shoulder Pads</option>\n                    <option value=\"EVA Foam\">EVA Foam</option>\n                    <option value=\"Woven & Knitted Elastics\">Woven &amp; Knitted Elastics</option>\n                    <option value=\"Tatron\">Tatron</option>\n                    <option value=\"Velcro Tape\">Velcro Tape</option>\n                    <option value=\"Not Sure / Multiple Products\">Not Sure / Multiple Products</option>\n                  </select>\n                  <div class=\"invalid-feedback\">This field is required.</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                  <label for=\"quantity\" class=\"form-label-custom\">Quantity Required <span class=\"req\">*</span></label>\n                  <input type=\"text\" class=\"form-control-custom\" id=\"quantity\" name=\"quantity\" placeholder=\"e.g. 5000 metres / 10000 pieces\" required>\n                  <div class=\"invalid-feedback\">This field is required.</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12\">\n                  <label for=\"message\" class=\"form-label-custom\">Additional Details</label>\n                  <textarea class=\"form-control-custom\" id=\"message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Specification, GSM, delivery timeline or any other detail\"></textarea>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12\">\n                  <div id=\"formAlert\" class=\"alert\" role=\"alert\"></div>\n                  <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-gold btn-lg-custom w-100\">Send Enquiry <i class=\"fas fa-paper-plane ms-2\"></i></button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </form>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
            "label": "Request A Bulk Quote"
        },
